      "created_at": "2024-05-08T11:50:25.603Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried this thing on v15.15.0 and v14.27.1 (version-14),</p>\n<p>What I want to get is the time between the issue ticket got created and the first response, and it seems that this is done already, <a href=\"https://docs.erpnext.com/docs/user/manual/en/issue#3-3-response\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">in the “Response Details” section</a>, and it goes farther to <a href=\"https://docs.erpnext.com/docs/user/manual/en/support_reports#1-first-response-time-for-issues\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">calculate the average time of response</a></p>\n<p>For me both versions, does not show “First Response Time” and “Average First Response Time” and the “First Responded On” can be manually entered, or auto assigned if the SLA changed, either to pause or resolved.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/6/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae_2_690x105.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gQFLZPz826FueusZPGMHBW5vQJw\" width=\"690\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae_2_690x105.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae_2_1035x157.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/6/7617129062980106e0131da1e0cf71a107e340ae.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×195 7.82 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discou