    {
      "id": 479324,
      "username": "dhruv-siprtc",
      "name": "Dhruv Vadoliya",
      "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:24:02.100Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ahmed_abdin\">@Ahmed_Abdin</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ncp\">@NCP</a><br>\nIn my case, the <strong>First Response Time</strong> in Issues is not getting auto-calculated. The field stays empty even though the code for updating it exists. It seems the calculation isn’t being triggered automatically when a response is added.</p>\n<p>Does anyone have insights into why this might be happening or if there is a configuration step I might be missing?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/dhruv-siprtc/{size}/89943_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 4,
