    {
      "id": 479355,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:08:33.391Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dhruv-siprtc\">@dhruv-siprtc</a></p>\n<p>The First Response is recorded only when you declared the status of the ticket to <strong>REPLIED</strong> and by the time you do it, system calculates response time from the standard you have set under SLA doctype and update in first response read only field.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e47774/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
